<FluentStack Orientation="Orientation.Vertical" VerticalGap="16px" Class="my-2">
    <FluentText>
        The <a href="/manage/training">Training Dashboard</a>'s By Course and By Person tabs show
        live status for every assignment. The Timing and Analytics tabs turn that into reports.
    </FluentText>

    <FluentText As="TextTag.H5" Size="TextSize.Size400">Timing reports</FluentText>
    <FluentText>
        For a selected course, shows the average time taken to complete it, plus a breakdown of
        average time spent per section, useful for spotting a section that's taking people far
        longer than expected.
    </FluentText>

    <FluentText As="TextTag.H5" Size="TextSize.Size400">Analytics reports</FluentText>
    <FluentText>
        For a selected course, shows top-scoring trainees, fastest completions, a donut chart of
        how the assigned group splits across Not Started / In Progress / Completed / Overdue, and
        a pass/fail donut for everyone's latest attempt.
    </FluentText>

    <FluentMessageBar Intent="MessageBarIntent.Info">
        Staff are emailed when a course is assigned to them, and again when it's due within the next
        7 days. Courses with recurrence enabled also send a retake reminder when someone's retake
        window comes up. There's no email once training is overdue, so check the dashboard for that
        rather than waiting for a notification.
    </FluentMessageBar>
</FluentStack>
